    - Compute the group homology $H_1(G, \mathbb{Z}) \cong G^{\mathrm{ab}}$ via the augmentation sequence $0 \to I_G \to \mathbb{Z}[G] \to \mathbb{Z} \to 0$.
    - State the local Artin isomorphism $K^\times / \operatorname{Nm}_{L/K}(L^\times) \cong \operatorname{Gal}(L/K)^{\mathrm{ab}}$ and the local fundamental class in $H^2(\operatorname{Gal}(L/K), L^\times) \cong \frac{1}{[L:K]}\mathbb{Z}/\mathbb{Z}$.

